# Phase discipline

Read [docs/master-spec.md](docs/master-spec.md) and the current phase doc before changing code.

Work only on the current phase. Phase 1 through Phase 10 are complete. See [docs/phase-10.md](docs/phase-10.md). Phase 11 is DCA. See [docs/phase-11.md](docs/phase-11.md).

Feature work happens on `develop`. Merge to `main` only when the user is ready for production.

Phase 11 is the first managing playbook. Type `dca` on the desk. Same `futures_*` ledger and `runFuturesCommand`. The app owns clips and exits. Signals only arm. Stacked playbooks, one per contract and side. Do not add a Fly.io worker. Do not call private exchange APIs from the browser. Paper accounts still use the in-app ledger.

Do not create later-phase tables or speculative architecture. Do not start scale-in, Hyperliquid, or MEXC/XT until Phase 11 is accepted.

Keep dependencies minimal. Prefer the simplest solution that satisfies the current phase.

Stop at the end of the phase. After acceptance criteria pass, report results and wait for instruction.
